    "name": "MyAdvisor - COMP 3613 Assignment 2 API Tests",
    "description": "Runs 17 ordered API requests for MyAdvisor degree progress, semester planning and advisor approval. Includes three new HTTP 400 negative tests (invalid grade, empty plan, invalid approval decision) plus existing student-admin authorization rejection (401). Requires the JSON API router extension and test accounts. Use a disposable test database and fresh test data for each full run. Do not commit passwords.",
